WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:02.521
Cora shot out an arm.

2
00:00:02.522 --> 00:00:05.071
She grabbed the baby grouper.

3
00:00:05.072 --> 00:00:10.806
Then she dived underwater.

4
00:00:10.807 --> 00:00:14.846
"You're safe now," Cora said.

5
00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:18.255
"Thank you!" the baby said.

6
00:00:18.256 --> 00:00:21.944
The other groupers swam over.

7
00:00:21.945 --> 00:00:26.684
"You saved my baby," one said.

8
00:00:26.685 --> 00:00:29.624
"Now we'll help you."

9
00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:32.900
"Thank you!" Cora said.

10
00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:38.227
"Follow me—fast!"

11
00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:41.028
Cora dived down toward the reef.

12
00:00:41.029 --> 00:00:45.898
The groupers followed her.

13
00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:49.768
Everyone was crowded around the big coral.

14
00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:53.643
"Hooray, Cora is back!" Mo shouted.

15
00:00:53.644 --> 00:00:57.076
"Make way, everyone!" Cora said.

16
00:00:57.077 --> 00:01:00.373
"Give these groupers room to dig."

17
00:01:00.374 --> 00:01:02.891
The groupers worked fast.

18
00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:07.245
They dug with their mouths and fins.

19
00:01:07.246 --> 00:01:11.282
Soon there was a big hole.

20
00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:18.340
Everyone tried moving the coral again.

21
00:01:18.341 --> 00:01:27.234
"It's still stuck," Cora said. "Keep digging!"

22
00:01:27.235 --> 00:01:31.238
The groupers dug deeper.

23
00:01:31.239 --> 00:01:36.026
Then everyone pushed again.

24
00:01:36.027 --> 00:01:40.116
Finally . . . the coral moved!

25
00:01:40.117 --> 00:01:46.564
The parrot fish swam out. "We're free!"

26
00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:50.006
"Thanks to the groupers," Cora said.

27
00:01:50.007 --> 00:02:00.723
"Everyone helped," the baby grouper said. "Bye!"

28
00:02:00.724 --> 00:02:04.149
Cora and Mo went back to her den.

29
00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:07.672
"Now are you ready for your trip?" Mo asked.

30
00:02:07.673 --> 00:02:15.733
"Yep!" Cora smiled. "The reef is safe again.

31
00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:23.569
I'll be back soon!"

